// bootSoupwannabes: the soups every internal store has.  bootRunInitScripts
// creates each one the store lacks from its soupDef, and adds the
// initialEntries (an array, or a function returning one): the alarms, In and
// Out Boxes, the Extras Drawer's entries, the Notepad, the calendar and to-do
// soups, and the directory of the built-in applications' soups.

bootSoupwannabes := [|Array|:
	{initialEntries: nil, soupDef: soupDef},
	{initialEntries: nil, soupDef: @inboxSoupDef},
	{initialEntries: nil, soupDef: @outboxSoupDef},
	// the Extras Drawer soup, with an entry for each built-in icon: the
	// applications and tools (ROMFormEntry: opens app), actions (ROMScriptEntry:
	// TapAction runs; it returns whether the drawer closes afterwards), the soups'
	// icons in the Storage folder (ROMSoupEntry, labels '_soups) and the button
	// bar's icons (labels '_buttonBar).  icon and iconPro index the ROM's icons
	// (extrasRomIcons.ns), sequence orders them
	{
		initialEntries: [|Array|:
			{
				class: 'ROMFormEntry,
				text: @paperrollSoupName,
				icon: 11,
				sequence: 2,
				labels: nil,
				_tagList: _tagList,
				app: 'paperroll,
				iconPro: 11
			},
			{
				class: 'ROMFormEntry,
				text: calls,
				icon: 12,
				sequence: 3,
				labels: nil,
				_tagList: _tagList,
				app: 'callapp,
				iconPro: 12,
